    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clean Stack is a little puzzle game that involves stacking odd-sized objects with fun physics without making anything touch the ground. There are lots of different objects, which creates some bizarre situations. You'll also need to use potions on the objects to get through the levels, which makes the game even more challenging! <br><br><strong>About Clean Stack</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Clean Stack is a extended version of a game made in the GMTK 2024 gamejam. The game is way longer with a bunch of new mechanics. The game has been designed to provide a pleasant, relaxing experience while retaining some challenge. In addition, there is <u>more bananas</u>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >its literally <strong><u>FREE</u></strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>65</i> levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Around 3-4 hours of gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A ton of fun and\u00a0<i>weird</i> achievements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >25+ differents items to play with</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 potions to make chaotic situations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A silly blue monster to <span class=\"bb_strike\">annoy</span> guide you though the game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An hard difficulty gamemode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bananas</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>And all the passion of a person in their creation</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bananas</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3276530/extras/adeb2c576f5bc2e6b85af6348cd7f511.avif?t=1754812266\" width=1429 height=1137 /></span></p>",
